1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,860
Here are two EURUSD trades. When you hold many trades, grouping makes the list shorter.

2
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:09,390
Turn on Grouped.

3
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:13,750
Now there is one row per instrument, with the total size of all its trades.

4
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:17,610
The open price is their average, marked with a wavy sign.

5
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:21,120
Click the arrow to see the trades inside the group.

6
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:25,480
Each trade is listed underneath, and you can still work with each one.

7
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:31,690
The X on the group row closes all of its trades together.

8
00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:36,910
Turn Grouped off to see every trade on its own row again.

